\f1\b0 \cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 3 rows had insured damage exceeding total damage (JAM 2024, JPN 2007, USA 2015 \'97 all storms/wildfire); removed as impossible. 683 \uc0\u8594  680.\
