Hazard categories with fewer than 10 events (Drought 8, Extreme temperature 7, Mass movement 4) dropped to avoid a rank-deficient design matrix. 593 \uc0\u8594  574.\
Baseline: 574 events, R\'b2 0.475. Rule of law strongest predictor (\uc0\u8722 0.102, p=0.005); income weak once institutions controlled (\u8722 0.052, p=0.095).\
VIFs all below 5 \'97 the three explanations are separable in this sample.\
Fractional logit agrees with OLS on signs and significance throughout.\
